  "full_text": "So, what do you want to do? So, I look fabulous. Like, I think I'm awake. I didn't sleep. I needed my beauty sleep. So, like, you know what's weird? There was a, on the Commodore, there was something called BioRhythms. The Commodore used to have a lot of miscellaneous junk software, and somebody took the time to make sinusoids that that had like I don't know a period of One days two days and three days or something like that. So they had they had three sinusoids one for your physical highs and lows your mental highs and lows and your emotional highs and lows so You know what's interesting is I was kind of a retard and What if that was therapy? I had a scientific mind and I just immediately rejected it. But what if I was retarded and they tried to give me therapy, a subtle hint, and what I failed to do was just look at myself. So like... If you notice, you have highs and lows. I didn't even notice. And there I was with that program in front of me. I didn't even notice. You do have highs and lows. I don't think it's sinusoid or anything like that. But you do have highs and lows. I don't know.",
